sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant E as Entry point
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant X as External system
    U->>E: request
    E->>O: dispatch
    alt required information missing
        O-->>E: ask a question
        E-->>U: question
        U->>E: answer
        E->>O: resume
    end
    O->>X: call
    X-->>O: response
    O->>O: format result
    O-->>E: output
    E-->>U: output
